  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MiNetwork: Facilitating Third Country Nationals&#x2019; Access to Social Services and the Greek Labour Market</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to promote the integration of Ukrainians and Third Country Nationals (TCNs) in the Greek socio-economic life in line with their skills, qualifications and aspirations, as well as the local communities&#x2019; needs and labour market context. IOM will particularly support the MoMA&apos;s SID in designing a digital platform (referred to as Social Inclusion Platform (SIP)) thus introducing a modern, user-friendly and sustainable digital tool to ease and coordinate the inclusion of Ukrainians and TCNs in different aspects of the Greek society. Particular emphasis will be placed on addressing the needs of Ukrainians and TCNs fleeing the conflict in Ukraine and arriving in Greece, to promote the quick and easy access of this group to meaningful information and tools.</narrative>
  </description>
